/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 228 0 R
/E (This project helped me understand that ethnography is less about solving a problem and more about recognizing patterns in how people experience a system. Through observation and conversation, I began noticing how symbols, traditions, and institutional decisions interact in ways that are not always consistent. UC Davis contains many identities, including agriculture, veterinary science, athletics, sustainability, and student culture. Understanding how those identities are represented is a complex process.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
