/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 229 0 R
/E (The research process did not lead to a single clear answer, but it did lead to better questions. Ethnography encouraged me to pay attention to contradictions that might normally go unnoticed. It also showed how design can be used not only to solve problems, but to start conversations. The story of Sunpebble is meant to spark those conversations. Through satire and narrative, the project invites viewers to reconsider how institutions construct identity and what those symbols truly represent.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
